## What each addon does

### LLMLingua (token compression)
- Pinned `llmlingua==0.2.2` exactly per security vetting
- Token-level perplexity-based prompt compression
- 5-20× compression on long prompts with minimal quality loss
- Upstream stale (~2 years); v3.6+ migration to SecurityLingua planned

### Graphiti (knowledge graph)
- Pinned `graphiti-core>=0.29.1` (CVE-2026-32247 floor) per security vetting
- Bi-temporal fact graph; backends: Kuzu (RECOMMENDED), Neo4j, FalkorDB
- PostHog telemetry DISABLED by default
- Apache 2.0 licensed

### Graphify (codebase symbol graph)
- Pinned `graphifyy==0.8.21` (DOUBLE-y; typosquat defended) per security vetting
- Tree-sitter based, 31 languages
- 4-layer typosquat defense (L1-L4)
- MIT licensed; 48h security response SLA

### Obsidian vault config (PKM addon)
- MVP scope shipped in v3.5 (memory_bank/ templates deferred to v3.5.1)
- 10 files: SKILL + README + INSTALL + 3 templates + community-plugins.json + hotkeys.json + obsidian_config/README
- No Python install; pure markdown + JSON config
- Obsidian desktop app: https://obsidian.md/ (user installs separately)

